  - text: "|"
  - button "I already donated"
  - text: We never sell your information. By submitting, you are agreeing to our
  - link "donor privacy policy":
    - /url: https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Policy:Donor_privacy_policy?uselang=en
  - text: . The Wikimedia Foundation is a nonprofit,
  - link "tax-exempt organization":
    - /url: https://wikimediafoundation.org/give/donor-frequently-asked-questions/#tax-deductibility
  - text: . If you make a recurring donation, you will be debited by the Wikimedia Foundation until you notify us to stop. We’ll send you an email which will include a link to
  - link "easy cancellation instructions":
    - /url: https://wikimediafoundation.org/give/manage-your-donation/
  - text: .
- text: Sorry to interrupt, but we can't show this to everyone. In fact, only a small fraction will see it. Please, donate $2.75.
